# Visor Tracker ship path

Read and follow `docs/VISOR_TRACKER_RELEASE.md`.

Publish the signed `Visor-Fast-Tracking.apk` as soon as `build-and-test` (unit tests + signing) succeeds. Tag `visor-tracker-vN` must match `versionCode` N.

`publish-release` must keep `needs: [build-and-test]` only. Do not reattach emulator jobs (`detector-simulation`, Android 16 install check) as a publish gate.

If GitHub or the in-app checker stalls: use **OPEN RELEASE PAGE**, direct download URLs, or create the Release from the already-signed Actions artifact. Do not make the owner wait on emulators.
